  "description": "Not your typical cruiser, the RevMX calls out to those wanting to split from the norm without breaking the bank. The RevMX fuses classic cruiser design with that of \"klunker\" mountain bikes from the late 70's. This cruiser crossover offers an upright seating position complemented by our Sun Moto Cruiser handlebar to keep you relaxed and in control. The extra-large 27.5\" wheels and tires ensure a fast, smooth ride even off the pavement.\nClassic klunker high-tensile steel frame\nSingle-speed drivetrain\nKT coaster brake\nOne-piece chromoly crank\n27.5\" double wall alloy rims with stainless steel spokes\n27.5\" x 2.40\" knobby tires\nMoto-cruiser steel handlebar\nRetro coil spring rivet saddle\nRemovable plastic chain guard\nSteel kickstand",
